{"h":"<p>Krea 2 照片写实主义的基本工作流程。结果不言而喻。</p><h3><strong>带有基本潜在高档的文本到图像。</strong></h3><ul><li><p>er_sde/beta，8-9 个步骤<strong>文本到图像</strong></p></li><li><p>exp_heun_2_x0/sgm_uniform，3步<strong>潜在高档</strong></p></li></ul><h3><strong>你需要的东西：</strong></h3><p><strong>型号：</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors</strong></a></p></li></ul><p><strong>文本编码器</strong>: </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors -</strong></a>使用 CLIPLoader 加载，输入<code>韩国2</code>:</p></li></ul><p><strong>VAE：</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/blob/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>qwen_image_vae.safetensors</strong></a></p></li></ul><p><strong>节点：</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/LoganBooker/SesquiLSR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/LoganBooker/SesquiLSR</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ClownsharkBatwing/RES4LYF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/ClownsharkBatwing/RES4LYF</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</strong></a></p></li></ul><h3><strong>喜欢吗？你可以在这里给我买一杯 Ko-Fi（我假设它是啤酒）：</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/raymondluxuryyachtrly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://ko-fi.com/raymondluxuryyachtrly</strong></a></p><p>谢谢！</p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>Basic workflow for Krea 2 photorealism. Results speak for themselves.</p><h3><strong>Text to Image w/Basic Latent Upscale.</strong></h3><ul><li><p>er_sde/beta, 8-9 steps for<strong>text-to-image</strong></p></li><li><p>exp_heun_2_x0/sgm_uniform, 3 steps for<strong>latent upscale</strong></p></li></ul><h3><strong>Things you need:</strong></h3><p><strong>Model:</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors</strong></a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Text Encoder</strong>: </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors -</strong></a>Load with CLIPLoader, type<code>krea2</code>:</p></li></ul><p><strong>VAE:</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/blob/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>qwen_image_vae.safetensors</strong></a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Nodes:</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/LoganBooker/SesquiLSR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/LoganBooker/SesquiLSR</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ClownsharkBatwing/RES4LYF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/ClownsharkBatwing/RES4LYF</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</strong></a></p></li></ul><h3><strong>Like it? You can buy me a Ko-Fi (I'll pretend it's a beer) here:</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/raymondluxuryyachtrly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://ko-fi.com/raymondluxuryyachtrly</strong></a></p><p>Thanks!</p>"